  "details": "I was really excited to see avatar dynamics become available for worlds late last year and I had ideas to create a custom avatar that would interact with my upcoming club world.  It's not a show stopper but I realized after testing that contacts are limited to 3 meters in size.  Obviously I can add more than 1 but I have to put roughly 36 of them to cover an area in my world to make sure that every spot is covered.\n\nIt would be nice if this limit was either increased or removed for worlds.",
